OL,3,AAnthropic researcher believes more than
OL,4,A10% chance AI 'could kill all humans'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA top safety researcher at Anthropic
OL,7,Fhas warned that AI is advancing so
OL,8,Fquickly he believes there is a greater
OL,9,Fthan 10% chance it "could kill all
OL,10,Fhumans" within the next decade.
OL,12,FEvan Hubinger said in a post on X that
OL,13,Fthe risk from the models which
OL,14,Fcurrently exist was "low" but he was
OL,15,F"worried" the technology might develop
OL,16,Fand improve itself soon to the point
OL,17,Fwhere it posed an existential risk to
OL,18,Fhumanity.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,107,105,200,160,0,100
